        "content": "<p>alexcrichton opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/15335\">issue #15335</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This script:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sys</span>\n<span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">n</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nb\">int</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">sys</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]),</span> <span class=\"mi\">20000</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">'(module (func (param i32) (result i32) (local i32)'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"s1\">'loop '</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"s1\">'local.get 1'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s1\">'local.get 0 i32.add '</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s1\">'local.set 1'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"s1\">' '</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">join</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s1\">'local.get 0 br_if </span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s1\">'</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">k</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">range</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span>\n      <span class=\"s1\">'end '</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"s1\">'local.get 1))'</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>generates a module that takes a long time to compile:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/files/34997302/d1000.wasm.txt\">d1000.wasm.txt</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/files/34997301/d2000.wasm.txt\">d2000.wasm.txt</a></p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">python3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">gen</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">py</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1000</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d1000</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wat</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">python3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">gen</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">py</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2000</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d2000</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wat</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cargo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"n\">release</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">compile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d1000</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wat</span>\n<span class=\"mf\">13.56</span><span class=\"n\">s</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cargo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"n\">release</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">compile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d2000</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wat</span>\n<span class=\"mf\">55.16</span><span class=\"n\">s</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Wasmtime 50.0.1 compiles each of them in about 0.1s.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
